<title>USA: U.S. stocks open higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks opened higher on Wednesday and analysts had said the firmer start could have been helped by momentum from Tueday's record close.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average was up 10 to 6,610, the Nasdaq Composite 1.68 higher at 1,329.41 and the S&amp;P Index up 0.76 at 753.99</p>
<p>The 30-year bond rose 3/32 to yield 6.78 percent.</p>
